    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brutal murder inside a collapsed broadcast studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the hidden truth through <strong>Communication x Survival x Adventure</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/f114058466268685a479535bbb3cb880.avif?t=1747276302\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Buried Stars</i> is a mystery adventure game from Studio LARGO\u2014the creators of the beloved Korean titles <i>Panic Room</i> and <i>City of Mist</i>\u2014in collaboration with LINE Games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Murder at a Survival Audition Gone Wrong</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/93f2d6f95d7717978d069ca5f5b30500.poster.avif?t=1747276302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/93f2d6f95d7717978d069ca5f5b30500.webm?t=1747276302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/93f2d6f95d7717978d069ca5f5b30500.mp4?t=1747276302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During a live broadcast of a survival audition show, the studio building suddenly collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trapped beneath the rubble, the remaining contestants and crew face something even more terrifying: a murder among them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who is the culprit? Why did this happen? And how?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Striking Visual Presentation with 3D x 2D Harmony</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic 2D character illustrations are blended into detailed 3D environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">to create an atmospheric and cinematic visual experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Gameplay through Social Media Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/186ed3f84d6e23a91deef0b32806172e.avif?t=1747276302\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep track of real-time public reactions via the in-game \u201cSocial Media\u201d and \u201cTimeline.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These systems not only deepen the immersion but also provide crucial hints to help uncover the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Branching Scenarios and Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/38b459a5c8551f66822f300ce186cf5d.avif?t=1747276302\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your dialogue choices and actions shape the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With multiple routes, endings, and hidden stories, each playthrough reveals new truths\u2014and new fates for the survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Powerful Soundtrack and Performances</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/dffc14a8c4ffde00de903c1d4d87cc05.poster.avif?t=1747276302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/dffc14a8c4ffde00de903c1d4d87cc05.webm?t=1747276302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/dffc14a8c4ffde00de903c1d4d87cc05.mp4?t=1747276302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the emotional intensity of the story with an original soundtrack, environmental sound design, and the gripping main theme, \u201cBe Honest.\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stellar Voice Acting in Korean and Japanese</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/bda8e2667f7ed4ba0752855e32777530.poster.avif?t=1747276302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/bda8e2667f7ed4ba0752855e32777530.webm?t=1747276302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/bda8e2667f7ed4ba0752855e32777530.mp4?t=1747276302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring passionate performances by seasoned voice talent from both Korea and Japan:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Korean Cast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Park Sungtae, Ryu Seunggon, Nam Dohyoung, Kim Yeonwoo, Kim Haru, Lee Kyoungtae, Lim Yoonsun, and more</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Japanese Cast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tetsuya Kakihara, Takuya Eguchi, Hiro Shimono, Yoko Hikasa, Rina Sato, Soichiro Hoshi, Eri Kitamura, and more</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brutal murder inside a collapsed broadcast studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the hidden truth through <strong>Communication x Survival x Adventure</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/f114058466268685a479535bbb3cb880.avif?t=1747276302\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Buried Stars</i> is a mystery adventure game from Studio LARGO\u2014the creators of the beloved Korean titles <i>Panic Room</i> and <i>City of Mist</i>\u2014in collaboration with LINE Games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Murder at a Survival Audition Gone Wrong</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/93f2d6f95d7717978d069ca5f5b30500.poster.avif?t=1747276302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/93f2d6f95d7717978d069ca5f5b30500.webm?t=1747276302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/93f2d6f95d7717978d069ca5f5b30500.mp4?t=1747276302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During a live broadcast of a survival audition show, the studio building suddenly collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trapped beneath the rubble, the remaining contestants and crew face something even more terrifying: a murder among them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who is the culprit? Why did this happen? And how?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Striking Visual Presentation with 3D x 2D Harmony</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic 2D character illustrations are blended into detailed 3D environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">to create an atmospheric and cinematic visual experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Gameplay through Social Media Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/186ed3f84d6e23a91deef0b32806172e.avif?t=1747276302\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep track of real-time public reactions via the in-game \u201cSocial Media\u201d and \u201cTimeline.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These systems not only deepen the immersion but also provide crucial hints to help uncover the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Branching Scenarios and Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/38b459a5c8551f66822f300ce186cf5d.avif?t=1747276302\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your dialogue choices and actions shape the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With multiple routes, endings, and hidden stories, each playthrough reveals new truths\u2014and new fates for the survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Powerful Soundtrack and Performances</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/dffc14a8c4ffde00de903c1d4d87cc05.poster.avif?t=1747276302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/dffc14a8c4ffde00de903c1d4d87cc05.webm?t=1747276302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/dffc14a8c4ffde00de903c1d4d87cc05.mp4?t=1747276302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the emotional intensity of the story with an original soundtrack, environmental sound design, and the gripping main theme, \u201cBe Honest.\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stellar Voice Acting in Korean and Japanese</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/bda8e2667f7ed4ba0752855e32777530.poster.avif?t=1747276302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/bda8e2667f7ed4ba0752855e32777530.webm?t=1747276302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025960/extras/bda8e2667f7ed4ba0752855e32777530.mp4?t=1747276302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring passionate performances by seasoned voice talent from both Korea and Japan:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Korean Cast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Park Sungtae, Ryu Seunggon, Nam Dohyoung, Kim Yeonwoo, Kim Haru, Lee Kyoungtae, Lim Yoonsun, and more</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Japanese Cast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tetsuya Kakihara, Takuya Eguchi, Hiro Shimono, Yoko Hikasa, Rina Sato, Soichiro Hoshi, Eri Kitamura, and more</i></p>",
    "short_description": "A mystery adventure set at the collapse site of a live survival audition show. Trapped contestants communicate with each other\u2014and the outside world through social media\u2014as they wait for rescue. But as unexpected events unfold, trust begins to crack, and survival becomes far more complicated.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cBuried Stars came out of nowhere but it has become one of my favorite visual novels of this year. The titles\u2019 fantastic presentation paired with the gripping narrative creates a unique experience within the genre.\u201d<br>95 \u2013 Noisy Pixel<br><br>\u201cBuried Stars will slip under the radar for most people; I implore you to check this wonderful visual novel out, as it\u2019s perhaps one of the best narrative experiences this year. With a relatable and fleshed out cast of characters mixed with simple yet engrossing mystery mechanics, this one deserves your time and attention.\u201d<br>90 \u2013 Gaming Trend<br><br>\u201cI really enjoyed Buried Stars, but being overwhelmed by how in-depth and involved all of the mechanics were was a frequent occurrence. The presentation was easily my favorite aspect, but it thankfully didn\u2019t do too much heavy lifting on the whole experience...Buried Stars left a very good impression and I\u2019m going to keep my eye out for their future releases\u201d<br>80 \u2013 Nintendo Insider<br>",
